This desktop port is an independent project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or maintained by reCloudStream.

The Kotlin sources under core/src were adapted from the CloudStream
`library` module (commonMain + jvmMain) so that existing `.cs3` plugins
continue to resolve `com.lagradost.cloudstream3.*` types.

Third-party runtime components downloaded by the app (not shipped in git):
- libmpv / mpv (LGPL) from shinchiro winbuilds, on first launch on Windows
- dex2jar (Apache-2.0) into the user tools directory when installing a .cs3 plugin
- Microsoft Edge WebView2 Evergreen runtime (installed by the user from Microsoft)

Shaka Player is loaded from jsDelivr in the DRM player page (Apache-2.0).
